            "notes": "Esta es la ronda m\u00e1s importante para que Tracer empiece a escalar. Como todav\u00eda hay menos \u201cone-shoots\u201d en el lobby, podemos abusar de la movilidad y hostigar a cuanto enemigo se mueva. El objetivo es hacer da\u00f1o a todo lo que veas para que te contabilice la baja aunque no remates t\u00fa.\n\nThis is the most important round for Tracer to start climbing. Since there are still fewer one-shots in the lobby, we can take advantage of her mobility and harass any enemy that moves. The goal is to damage everything you see so that you get the kill count even if you don't finish them off yourself.",
