            "notes": "Aqu\u00ed empieza lo peligroso. Con Overdrive Core ganas la capacidad de mantener un DPS alto constante. Como ya existen \u201cone-shoots\u201d, tu estilo debe ser hostigar y salir r\u00e1pido, nunca quedarte m\u00e1s de 2\u20133 segundos en la misma zona.\n\nOverdrive Core \u2192 Indispensable, activa tu \u201ccarrileo\u201d.\n\nShieldbuster \u2192 Si el enemigo stackea armaduras/escudos, este \u00edtem es oro puro (15% attack speed por solo 4k).\n\nWeapon Grease \u2192 Potencia tu cadencia de tiro y encaja con la movilidad.\n\nVentas:\nCompensator, Plasma Converter, First Aid Kit.\n(Son \u00edtems que ya cumplieron su funci\u00f3n de early sustain, ahora necesitas puro power spike).\n\n---\nThis is where it gets dangerous. With Overdrive Core, you gain the ability to maintain consistently high DPS. Since there are already \u201cone-shots,\u201d your style should be to harass and get out quickly, never staying in the same area for more than 2\u20133 seconds.\n\nOverdrive Core \u2192 Indispensable, activates your \u201ccarry potential.\u201d\n\nShieldbuster \u2192 If the enemy stacks armor/shields, this item is pure gold (15% attack speed for only 4k).\n\nWeapon Grease \u2192 Boosts your firing rate and fits with mobility.\n\nSales:\nCompensator, Plasma Converter, First Aid Kit.\n(These items have already served their purpose of early sustain, now you need pure power spike).",
