            "notes": "Aqu\u00ed es donde Tracer empieza a brillar en 1v1. El truco es aislar enemigos y evitar peleas en desventaja num\u00e9rica. Un ejemplo seria un tiro de Kiri + cualquier cosa extra puede borrarte en segundos, as\u00ed que juega alrededor de tu movilidad y siempre busca objetivos solitarios.\n\nPower: Timelapse \u2192 Te salva de burst repentino y te da segunda oportunidad.\n\nEye of the Spider \u2192 Tu \u00edtem principal de da\u00f1o sostenido.\n\nOverdrive Core \u2192 Core absoluto.\n\nShieldbuster \u2192 Se mantiene si siguen con armaduras.\n\nWeapon Grease \u2192 Da\u00f1o y fluidez extra.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Si sientes que mueres demasiado r\u00e1pido, sacrifica un poco de da\u00f1o por 100 de armadura para sobrevivir al burst inicial.\n\n\n---\nThis is where Tracer really shines in 1v1 combat. The trick is to isolate enemies and avoid fights where you're outnumbered. For example, a shot from Kiri + anything extra can wipe you out in seconds, so play around your mobility and always look for lone targets.\n\nPower: Timelapse \u2192 Saves you from sudden bursts and gives you a second chance.\n\nEye of the Spider \u2192 Your main sustained damage item.\n\nOverdrive Core \u2192 Absolute core.\n\nShieldbuster \u2192 Stays if they keep their armor.\n\nWeapon Grease \u2192 Extra damage and fluidity.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f If you feel like you're dying too quickly, sacrifice some damage for 100 armor to survive the initial burst.",
