            "notes": "De aqui es sencillo, solo ser\u00e1 comprar da\u00f1o de arma dependiendo de lo que lleve el enemigo, si tienen muchas curas \"El-Sa'ka Supressor\" es una muy buena elecci\u00f3n, si tienen mucha armadura Codebreaker, y asi dependiendo de lo que necesites\n\nFrom here on, it's simple. Just buy weapon damage depending on what the enemy has. If they have a lot of healing abilities, El-Sa'ka Supressor is a very good choice. If they have a lot of armor, Codebreaker is a good choice. And so on, depending on what you need.",
